@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-access-token
@productId = 1
@calculationId = 1
@inquiryId = 1
@quotationId = 1
@supplierOrderId = 1
@customerOrderId = 1

### Product flow includes all related calculation branches
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ordernavigation/product/{{productId}}/flow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Calculation flow excludes sibling calculations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ordernavigation/calculation/{{calculationId}}/flow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inquiry flow
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ordernavigation/inquiry/{{inquiryId}}/flow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Quotation flow
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ordernavigation/quotation/{{quotationId}}/flow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Supplier order flow uses visible order numbers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ordernavigation/supplierorder/{{supplierOrderId}}/flow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customer order flow includes inherited parent links
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ordernavigation/customerorder/{{customerOrderId}}/flow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing record returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ordernavigation/product/2147483647/flow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unsupported entity type returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ordernavigation/unknown/1/flow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
